  <payload>
    <policy_name>trace_compaction_checkpoint_skeleton</policy_name>
    <checkpoint_reason_default>operator_checkpoint_for_long_trace_reconstruction</checkpoint_reason_default>
    <max_events_before_checkpoint>50</max_events_before_checkpoint>
    <include_failed_attempts>true</include_failed_attempts>
    <include_established_facts>true</include_established_facts>
    <preservation_mode>checkpoint_only_no_trace_deletion</preservation_mode>
    <notes>
      <item>Compaction checkpoint is reconstruction aid only and not runtime SSOT.</item>
      <item>execution_trace source events remain immutable and append-only.</item>
    </notes>
